{
  "$comment": "runway 'Greifbar': the one token source for web (CSS variables) and Android (Kotlin theme). Brand values are references to the Agentic Reach kit (brand/tokens.css); every other colour is a mix of brand colours. `node tokens.mjs` writes tokens.css (used by both prototype pages) and Tokens.kt (resolved sRGB, for runway-android). Edit this file, never the outputs.",
